.B cabal new-repl

Usage: cabal new-repl [TARGET] [FLAGS]


Open an interactive session for a component within the project. The available
targets are the same as for the 'new-build' command: individual components
within packages in the project, including libraries, executables, test-suites
or benchmarks. Packages can also be specified in which case the library
component in the package will be used, or the (first listed) executable in the
package if there is no library.

Dependencies are built or rebuilt as necessary. Additional configuration flags
can be specified on the command line and these extend the project
configuration from the 'cabal.project', 'cabal.project.local' and other files.


