.B cabal v1-reconfigure

Usage: cabal v1-reconfigure [FLAGS]


Run `configure` with the most recently used flags, or append FLAGS to the most
recently used configuration. Accepts the same flags as `cabal v1-configure'.
If the package has never been configured, the default flags are used.


Examples:
  cabal v1-reconfigure
    Configure with the most recently used flags.
  cabal v1-reconfigure -w PATH
    Reconfigure with the most recently used flags,
    but use the compiler at PATH.


